Using the commands below too manually create `.docker/config.json` file.

```bash
BASE64_AUTH=$(echo -n "$REGISTRY_USER:$REGISTRY_PASSWORD" | base64)
mkdir -p ~/.docker
echo "{\"auths\": {\"$REGISTRY_HOSTNAME\": {\"auth\": \"$BASE64_AUTH\"}}}" > ~/.docker/config.json
```

